    <title>使用LangChain构建本地知识库</title>
    <link href="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/"/>
    <url>/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>&#x2F;&#x2F;</p><h3 id="基于LangChain框架搭建一个本地智能问答系统"><a href="#基于LangChain框架搭建一个本地智能问答系统" class="headerlink" title="基于LangChain框架搭建一个本地智能问答系统"></a>基于LangChain框架搭建一个本地智能问答系统</h3><p>目前最主流的方案是<strong>RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation，检索增强生成）</strong></p><h3 id="一、-系统架构设计"><a href="#一、-系统架构设计" class="headerlink" title="一、 系统架构设计"></a>一、 系统架构设计</h3><p>一个标准的 RAG 智能文档问答系统包含以下 5 个核心模块：</p><ol><li><strong>文档加载 (Document Loading)：</strong> 根据不同的文件后缀（.pdf, .docx, .txt），使用对应的 Loader 将文档内容读取为纯文本格式。</li><li><strong>文本切分 (Text Splitting)：</strong> 因为 LLM 有上下文长度限制，需要将长文档切分成合适大小的“文本块 (Chunks)”。</li><li><strong>向量化 (Embedding)：</strong> 使用 Embedding 模型（如 OpenAI、HuggingFace 或 Bge 模型）将文本块转换为数学向量。这里选择openAI的text-embedding-3-small模型</li><li><strong>向量数据库 (Vector Store)：</strong> 将转换后的向量存储起来（如 FAISS, Chroma,Qdrant），以便快速进行相似度检索。这里为了方便，选择Qdrant的本地内存形式的向量存储</li><li><strong>大模型问答 (LLM Generation)：</strong> 用户提出问题后，系统在向量数据库中检索出最相关的文本块，将其作为“背景知识”连同用户问题一起提交给大语言模型（LLM），由大模型生成最终的准确答案。</li></ol><h3 id="二、完整的项目代码："><a href="#二、完整的项目代码：" class="headerlink" title="二、完整的项目代码："></a>二、完整的项目代码：</h3><p>requirements.txt：</p><figure class="highlight apache"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs apache"><span class="hljs-attribute">duckdb</span>&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">1</span>.<span class="hljs-number">4</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>-core&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>-openai&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>-text-splitters&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>-community&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">langchain</span>-qdrant&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">2</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">qdrant</span>-client&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">1</span>.<span class="hljs-number">9</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">python</span>-dotenv&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">1</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">pypdf</span>&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">4</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">0</span><br><span class="hljs-attribute">docx2txt</span>&gt;=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>.<span class="hljs-number">8</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>完整代码：</p><p>flower_question.py</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br><span class="line">103</span><br><span class="line">104</span><br><span class="line">105</span><br><span class="line">106</span><br><span class="line">107</span><br><span class="line">108</span><br><span class="line">109</span><br><span class="line">110</span><br><span class="line">111</span><br><span class="line">112</span><br><span class="line">113</span><br><span class="line">114</span><br><span class="line">115</span><br><span class="line">116</span><br><span class="line">117</span><br><span class="line">118</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_openai <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> OpenAI, ChatOpenAI, OpenAIEmbeddings<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 导入文档加载器</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_community.document_loaders <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> PyPDFLoader, Docx2txtLoader, TextLoader<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 导入文本切分器</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_text_splitters <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter<br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.prompts <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> PromptTemplate, ChatPromptTemplate<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> os<br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> dotenv <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> load_dotenv<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">#导入向量数据库</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> qdrant_client <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> QdrantClient<br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_qdrant <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> QdrantVectorStore<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 导入核心链(Chain)</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_classic.chains <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> create_retrieval_chain<br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_classic.chains.combine_documents <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> (<br>    create_stuff_documents_chain,<br>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_core.prompts <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> ChatPromptTemplate<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">#导入环境变量</span><br>load_dotenv()<br><span class="hljs-comment"># 你的 API Key</span><br>custom_api_key = os.getenv(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;CUSTOM_API_KEY&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-comment"># 你的自定义中转/代理/本地 URL (注意：通常要以 /v1 结尾)</span><br>custom_url = os.getenv(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;CUSTOM_URL&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">IntelligentDocQA</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">__init__</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self,  model_name: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;gpt-3.5-turbo&quot;</span></span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 初始化大语言模型 (LLM)</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.llm = ChatOpenAI(<br>            model=model_name, <br>            temperature=<span class="hljs-number">0.1</span>,<br>            api_key=custom_api_key,<br>            base_url=custom_url  <br>        )<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 初始化文本嵌入模型 (OpenAI Embeddings)</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings(<br>            model=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text-embedding-3-small&quot;</span>,<br>            api_key=custom_api_key,<br>            base_url=custom_url<br>        )<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 初始化文本切分器 (使用递归字符切分，最适合自然语言)</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.text_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=<span class="hljs-number">500</span>,      <span class="hljs-comment"># 每个文本块的最大字符数</span><br>            chunk_overlap=<span class="hljs-number">50</span>,    <span class="hljs-comment"># 相邻文本块的重叠字符数，防止句子被生硬截断</span><br>            separators=[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n\n&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;。&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;！&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;？&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;，&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot; &quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>]<br>        )<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 4. Qdrant 数据库初始化 (纯内存模式)</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.client = QdrantClient(location=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;:memory:&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.collection_name = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;doc_qa_memory_collection&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-comment"># 集合(表)名称</span><br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 5. 向量数据库实例</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store = <span class="hljs-literal">None</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">load_documents</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, base_dir: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>):<br>        documents = []<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> file <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> os.listdir(base_dir):     <span class="hljs-comment"># 构建完整的文件路径    </span><br>            file_path = os.path.join(base_dir, file)    <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.pdf&#x27;</span>):        <br>                loader = PyPDFLoader(file_path)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())    <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.docx&#x27;</span>):         <br>                loader = Docx2txtLoader(file_path)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())   <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.txt&#x27;</span>):        <br>                loader = TextLoader(file_path, encoding=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">raise</span> ValueError(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;暂不支持该文件格式: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;file&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;成功加载: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;base_dir&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> documents<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">create_vector_store</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, split_docs: <span class="hljs-built_in">list</span></span>):<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 首次写入，创建集合并存入内存</span><br>            <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store = QdrantVectorStore.from_documents(<br>                documents=split_docs,<br>                embedding=<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.embeddings,<br>                location=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;:memory:&quot;</span>,<br>                collection_name=<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.collection_name<br>            )<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 追加写入内存</span><br>            <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store.add_documents(split_docs)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">ask_question</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, query: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>:<br>        <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">        提问并获取回答</span><br><span class="hljs-string">        &quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;请先使用 create_vector_store() 方法加载至少一份文档。&quot;</span><br><br>        system_prompt = (<br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;你是一个智能文档问答助手。请严格按照以下检索到的【背景知识】来回答用户的问题。\n&quot;</span><br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;如果你不知道答案，或者背景知识中没有相关信息，请直接回答&#x27;根据提供的文档，我无法回答该问题&#x27;，不要编造答案。\n&quot;</span><br>            <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n【背景知识】:\n&#123;context&#125;&quot;</span><br>        )<br>        prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([<br>            (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;system&quot;</span>, system_prompt),<br>            (<span class="hljs-string">&quot;human&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&#123;input&#125;&quot;</span>),<br>        ])<br><br>        question_answer_chain = create_stuff_documents_chain(<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.llm, prompt)<br>        <br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 创建检索器，Qdrant 默认取最相关的 4 个片段</span><br>        retriever = <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store.as_retriever(search_kwargs=&#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;k&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">4</span>&#125;)<br>        rag_chain = create_retrieval_chain(retriever, question_answer_chain)<br><br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;🧠 正在检索内存知识库并思考: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;query&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>        response = rag_chain.invoke(&#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;input&quot;</span>: query&#125;)<br>        <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> response[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;answer&quot;</span>]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>app.py</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> flask <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> Flask, render_template, request<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> flower_question <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> IntelligentDocQA<br><br>app = Flask(__name__)<br>qa_system = IntelligentDocQA(model_name=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;gpt-3.5-turbo&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">get_answer</span>(<span class="hljs-params">question: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. 加载文档</span><br>    documents = qa_system.load_documents(base_dir=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;.\oneflower&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> documents:<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;❌ 没有成功加载任何文档。&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span><br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. 切分文本</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;✂️ 正在进行文本切分...&quot;</span>)<br>    split_docs = qa_system.text_splitter.split_documents(documents)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;✅ 切分完成，共得到 <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;<span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(split_docs)&#125;</span> 个文本块。&quot;</span>)<br><br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. 写入Qdrant内存数据库</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;⚡ 正在写入 Qdrant 内存数据库...&quot;</span>)<br>    qa_system.create_vector_store(documents)<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> qa_system.ask_question(question)<br><span class="hljs-meta">@app.route(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-string">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, methods=[<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>]</span>)</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">index</span>():<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> request.method == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;POST&#x27;</span>:        <br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 接收用户输入作为问题</span><br>        question = request.form.get(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;question&#x27;</span>)                        <br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># RetrievalQA链 - 读入问题，生成答案</span><br>        result = get_answer(question)  <br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;result: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;result&#125;</span>&quot;</span>) <br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>   render_template(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;index.html&#x27;</span>, result=result)           <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 把大模型的回答结果返回网页进行渲染        </span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> render_template(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;index.html&#x27;</span>)        <br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:<br>    app.run(debug=<span class="hljs-literal">True</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>网页效果展示：</p><img src="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/image-20260310140945182.png" class="" title="这里是图片的文字描述"><h4 id="1、文本的导入；"><a href="#1、文本的导入；" class="headerlink" title="1、文本的导入；"></a>1、文本的导入；</h4><p>这步就是按照源文档的类型进行相应的load</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">load_documents</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, base_dir: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>):<br>        documents = []<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> file <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> os.listdir(base_dir):     <span class="hljs-comment"># 构建完整的文件路径    </span><br>            file_path = os.path.join(base_dir, file)    <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.pdf&#x27;</span>):        <br>                loader = PyPDFLoader(file_path)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())    <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.docx&#x27;</span>):         <br>                loader = Docx2txtLoader(file_path)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())   <br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> file.endswith(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.txt&#x27;</span>):        <br>                loader = TextLoader(file_path, encoding=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>)        <br>                documents.extend(loader.load())<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>                <span class="hljs-keyword">raise</span> ValueError(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;暂不支持该文件格式: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;file&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;成功加载: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;base_dir&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> documents<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="2、文本切割："><a href="#2、文本切割：" class="headerlink" title="2、文本切割："></a>2、文本切割：</h4><p>需要将源文档进行切割，切割成更小的块，以便于嵌入（Embedding）和向量存储</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> langchain_text_splitters <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter<br><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.text_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=<span class="hljs-number">500</span>,      <span class="hljs-comment"># 每个文本块的最大字符数</span><br>            chunk_overlap=<span class="hljs-number">50</span>,    <span class="hljs-comment"># 相邻文本块的重叠字符数，防止句子被生硬截断</span><br>            separators=[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n\n&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;。&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;！&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;？&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;，&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot; &quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>]<br>        )<br>split_docs = qa_system.text_splitter.split_documents(documents)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里需要注意<strong>切割的粒度</strong>，粒度直接决定了向量数据库的检索质量。<strong>如果切的太粗，语义会模糊，如果切的太细，会丢失上下文</strong>。</p><p>比如上面相同的文档，chunk_size &#x3D; 500时，切割结果为49个块；当chunk_size&#x3D;1000时，切割结果为37个文本块。</p><ul><li><p>当切割的太细，比如chunk_size&lt;100, 像是在看碎纸机，模型很难知道“它”指代的是什么；</p></li><li><p>当切割的太粗（比如chunk_size&gt;1000),一句话包含太多关键词，向量化后会稀释掉关键特征，导致搜索不准；</p></li></ul><p>通常建议chunk_size设置为<strong>300-800</strong>之间，但是要具体场景具体分析。</p><p>chunk_overlap：为了防止重要信息刚好被切在两个块的交界处。一般设置为chunk_size的<strong>10%-20%</strong>。</p><p><strong>实践效果：</strong></p><p>测试实际的chunk_size&#x3D;500（chunk_overlap&#x3D;50）和chunk_size&#x3D;20（chunk_overlap&#x3D;2）的情况，相同的问题的结果展示：</p><ul><li>问题1：什么情况下，公司可以强制辞退员工？</li></ul><p>1、chuank_size&#x3D;500</p><img src="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/image-20260310172920559.png" class="" title="这里是图片的文字描述"><p>2、chunk_size&#x3D;20</p><img src="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/image-20260310173027488.png" class="" title="这里是图片的文字描述"><p>注意：在这个例子中，如果是一般的简单问题，从结果上很难看到两者的区别，只有在处理复杂问题的时候，才能看出两者的区别。</p><ul><li>问题2：法定全年假期有多少天</li></ul><p>1、chuank_size&#x3D;500</p><img src="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/image-20260310173557796.png" class="" title="这里是图片的文字描述"><p>2、chunk_size&#x3D;2000</p><img src="/2026/03/09/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E5%BA%93/image-20260310173628181.png" class="" title="这里是图片的文字描述"><p>​</p><p>上面两个问题的区别：问题1是个综合问题，文中的场景比较多，属于比较复杂的问题，这个时候如果粒度过细，则总结能力会减弱；问题2属于细节问题，这个在文中是一句话中的细节，如果粒度过粗，则可能会忽略到文本块中的细节。</p><p>总结后我们得到哪些场景适合细粒度，哪些场景适合粗粒度：</p><p>你可以根据原始文件的性质来决定：</p><ol><li>法律条文&#x2F;规章制度：建议较细粒度。每一条规则都是独立的，混合在一起会干扰检索。</li><li>小说&#x2F;传记&#x2F;叙事散文：建议中等粒度 + 较高重叠度。需要维持故事情节的连续性。</li></ol><h4 id="3、向量化-检索"><a href="#3、向量化-检索" class="headerlink" title="3、向量化 &amp; 检索"></a>3、向量化 &amp; 检索</h4><p>将切割后的文本进行向量化，存入向量数据库，在问答的适合进行检索</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs Python"><span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings(<br>            model=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;text-embedding-3-small&quot;</span>,<br>            api_key=custom_api_key,<br>            base_url=custom_url<br>        )<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">create_vector_store</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, split_docs: <span class="hljs-built_in">list</span></span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>:<br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 首次写入，创建集合并存入内存</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store = QdrantVectorStore.from_documents(<br>            documents=split_docs,<br>            embedding=<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.embeddings,<br>            location=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;:memory:&quot;</span>,<br>            collection_name=<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.collection_name<br>        )<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 追加写入内存</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store.add_documents(split_docs)<br>        <br>question_answer_chain = create_stuff_documents_chain(<span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.llm, prompt)<br>        <br><span class="hljs-comment"># 创建检索器，Qdrant 默认取最相关的 4 个片段</span><br>retriever = <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.vector_store.as_retriever(search_kwargs=&#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;k&quot;</span>: <span class="hljs-number">4</span>&#125;)<br>rag_chain = create_retrieval_chain(retriever, question_answer_chain)<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;🧠 正在检索内存知识库并思考: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;query&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>response = rag_chain.invoke(&#123;<span class="hljs-string">&quot;input&quot;</span>: query&#125;)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>向量化并存储的过程</p><p>Embedding的过程是将<strong>非结构化的离散文本数据</strong>转为<strong>连续的高维向量空间</strong>的过程，从而将比较两个文本转为计算两个向量的“<strong>距离</strong>”（一般采用余弦相似度来计算）。</p><p>其实总结起来也就是下面4个步骤：</p><p><strong>1.输入</strong>：非结构化文本</p><p><strong>2.变换</strong>：通过Embedding模型投影至高维空间</p><p><strong>3.度量</strong>：以余弦相似度为尺子，在空间中寻找“离问题最近”的知识</p><p><strong>4.输出</strong>：提取相关的上下文，喂给大模型。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
